@startuml
!include common.iuml
[*] --> Monitoring : plot registered\n(satellite + soil data)
state Monitoring : root zone above\nreadily-available threshold
state "Due Soon" as Soon : 2-7 days to irrigation
state "Due Today / Tomorrow" as Due : depletion near RAW
state "Rain Skip" as Rain : forecast rain refills\nroot zone
state "Water Stressed" as Stress : depletion beyond RAW\n(Ks < 1)
state Irrigating : pump scheduled in\npower window
state Refilled : root zone at\nfield capacity
Monitoring --> Soon : ETc depletes soil
Soon --> Due : depletion continues
Due --> Rain : forecast >= 5 mm moves\nirrigation date later
Rain --> Monitoring : rain received
Rain --> Due : forecast fails
Due --> Irrigating : advisory accepted /\nslot allocated
Due --> Stress : irrigation delayed
Stress --> Irrigating : high priority (WSPT)
Irrigating --> Refilled : volume delivered
Refilled --> Monitoring
Monitoring --> [*] : harvest
@enduml
